# Frozen benchmark instances and generated audit reports are checksummed
# scientific evidence (environments/instances/CHECKSUMS.sha256, manifest.json).
# Git's automatic CRLF<->LF normalisation would rewrite their bytes on
# checkout and invalidate those hashes on a fresh clone, so keep them
# byte-exact.
environments/instances/*.csv -text
environments/reports/*.csv   -text
experiments/reports/*.csv    -text
experiments/heteroscedastic/instances/*.csv -text
